uminated ''EXIT'' required (red/green in Philippines)", "type": "fact"}, {"text": "Standards Applied: RA 9514 Fire Code of the Philippines, NBCP Section 11 (Means of Egress)", "type": "definition"}]'::jsonb, true, false, false, false, 'ale-dsgn-008-01'
