 width: 3.0-3.5m per lane minimum", "type": "fact"}, {"text": "Parking lot surface: asphalt or concrete, 5-10cm depth typical", "type": "fact"}, {"text": "Shared/flexible parking: allows reduction in total spaces (office/retail mix)", "type": "fact"}, {"text": "On-street parking: 2.5m width × 6.0m depth standard (street design)", "type": "fact"}, {"text": "Standards Applied: PD 1096 Development Controls, NBCP Parking Standards, Time-Saver Standards", "type": "fact"}]'::jsonb, true, false, false, false, 'ale-dsgn-010-01'
